{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crusator is a dynamic twin-stick shooter with RPG elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a durable combat robot capable of shooting, throwing grenades, and transforming into a ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to protect people... But where is everyone? Only robots remain on Earth. Now your goal is to find out what happened to the people. And if anyone is left, protect them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapons and abilities. Enemies are unmerciful and won't wait for you to level up. But each enemy has its own strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through beautiful ruins of majestic cities, discover secrets and hidden paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing can stop you. Except the battery charge.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052830?t=1774887697","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052830?t=1774887697","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052830/79d8e9eef797be35ebf5f8d4ab9b2d8bce12680c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774887697","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052830/79d8e9eef797be35ebf5f8d4ab9b2d8bce12680c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774887697","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crusator is a dynamic twin-stick shooter with RPG elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a durable combat robot capable of shooting, throwing grenades, and transforming into a ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to protect people... But where is everyone? Only robots remain on Earth. Now your goal is to find out what happened to the p